<title>USA: Siemens signs pact with Emery.</title>
<headline>Siemens signs pact with Emery.</headline>
<dateline>REDWOOD CITY, Calif. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Siemens AG Wednesday said it signed a four-year, $30 million agreement with Emery Worldwide for domestic U.S. air freight services.</p>
<p>Under the new agreement, Emery provides all of Siemens' U.S. divisions with NextDay, Second-Day and deferred delivery services for customer and supplier shipments as well as inter-company freight movements.</p>
<p>Emery is a unit of CNF Transportation Inc.</p>
